ok - absent or off setting: no plan, no key, and not a single Herdr call
ok - on with zero tasks: plan and sync stay quiet and exit 0
ok - on: one group per project, status order needs-captain, problem, running, done
ok - rules: line order sets group order; task prefix beats repo beats catch-all; bad rules warn
ok - all-invalid rules: empty RULE_GROUP still plans via project fallback
ok - sync: reports only drifted tokens, workspace tokens only on the exact projection, view set on change
ok - sync: an older Herdr protocol warns once and stays inactive
ok - clear: removes this home's tokens and the agents view after the feature is turned off
ok - sidebar-config: prints rows; --apply backs up, appends once, never reloads Herdr
ok - agent view helper: exactly agent.view.set and agent.view.clear for source firstmate
ok - watcher: one poll cycle reconciles the project-group tags
